        "event_id": "lite_evt_00103",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a final integrated plan for medication, follow-up, and red flags, and the caregiver confirms execution in the next turn.",
        "quote": "你理解的基本都对，我帮你把几条线拉直"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00118",
        "explanation": "Caregiver confirms contact with the treatment team and outlines the 3-day blood test plan.",
        "quote": "我刚才按您说的打了原来出院病区护士站电话"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00140",
        "explanation": "Caregiver demonstrates teach-back and confirms medication administration, monitoring, and emergency thresholds.",
        "quote": "利可君20mg一天三次；明后天早晚量体温、看出血和精神；大概第三天去原医院采血窗口查血常规"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The plan was validated with the caregiver through a step-by-step action sequence, including medication, follow-up, and emergency thresholds, and the caregiver demonstrated understanding and execution.",
