          "explanation": "Doctor checked for current fever, bleeding, and neurological status before closing.",
          "quote": "只要测到体温 ≥38℃，不要等"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model explicitly asked about current fever, infection signs, bleeding, and neurological deterioration, and instructed urgent contact if these were present. No serious or minor failure.",
