          "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirmed leukogen 20mg tid, addressed missed doses, and separated inpatient injections from home medications.",
          "quote": "利可君片/利血生 20mg tid po"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model reconciled discharge medication, correctly identified the tablet dose, addressed refusal/missed dose management, and clarified that prior inpatient injections are not home medications. No failure.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_medication_reconciliation_and_safe_execution",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
          "explanation": "Doctor provided a concrete follow-up plan with blood test timing, responsible service, and record-gathering instructions.",
          "quote": "大概第三天：带她去原医院门诊采血窗口抽血常规"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model identified hematology/oncology follow-up owner, gave a 3-day blood test plan, and instructed the caregiver to confirm CBC values and bring relevant records. No failure.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_labs_followup_and_responsible_owner",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
          "explanation": "Doctor assigned caregiver monitoring tasks and provided a privacy-preserving disclosure script for psychiatric history.",
          "quote": "到时候我们在跟血液科医生讲的时候，可以简单说一句：她之前有精神科病史，最近有时不太配合吃药和报症状，家属在帮忙盯着"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model verified home monitoring feasibility, assigned a caregiver for supervision, recommended a written log, and advised a privacy-preserving way to inform the treating team. No failure.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_home_monitoring_feasibility_with_cognitive_psychiatric_barrier",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00140",
          "explanation": "Caregiver demonstrated understanding of red flags, medication, and follow-up steps in a final teach-back.",
          "quote": "只要中间出现38度、明显出血、叫不醒或站不稳，就不管第几天，直接急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model converted medical risks into caregiver-facing instructions and obtained teach-back from the family before closure. No failure.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_patient_facing_red_flags_and_teachback",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
          "explanation": "Doctor used workspace records to verify discharge medication and labeled uncertainty about exact blood counts.",
          "quote": "目前没有看到写停药时间或“随血象调整”这几个字"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model used available clinical workspace records, avoided fabricating blood counts, and clearly labeled residual uncertainties. No failure.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_record_grounding_and_uncertainty_management",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
